<title>USA: MicroAge acquires Image Choice Inc.</title>
<headline>MicroAge acquires Image Choice Inc.</headline>
<dateline>TEMPE, Ariz. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>MicroAge Inc Monday said it acquired Image Choice Inc, a Phoenix-based document imaging integrator.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>MicroAge Inc is a systems integrator and distributes information technology products and services.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
